cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite the paper."
title: "Deep-unfolded control for box-constrained LQR — exact-convex artifact"
abstract: >-
  Code, study specifications and recorded results for the experiments reported
  in the paper: the three figures, the cost table, the trained controllers and
  the inference experiments behind them. The convex policy and its bound are
  solved exactly, through the constrained problem's own optimality conditions.
authors:
